---
import '../../styles/handoff-tools.css';
---
<section id="model-support" class="tt-support d-section" data-model-support aria-labelledby="model-support-heading">
  <div class="d-wrap">
    <div class="d-heading"><div><p class="d-kicker">Here for the long run</p><h2 id="model-support-heading">Find your model.{' '}<br />Keep the music.</h2></div><p>Explore current products and find help for earlier systems, with manuals and information straight from Russound.</p></div>
    <div class="tt-support-grid">
      <div class="tt-model-tool">
        <form class="tt-model-form" data-model-form action="https://russound.com/document-center/">
          <label for="russound-model">Enter a model number</label>
          <div class="tt-search-field"><input id="russound-model" name="model" type="search" placeholder="For example, SMZ8 or XTS7" autocomplete="off" maxlength="80" aria-describedby="model-search-hint" /><button class="d-button" type="submit">Look up <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
        </form>
        <div class="tt-model-examples" aria-label="Try a model"><span>Try</span><button type="button" data-model-example="SMZ8">SMZ8</button><button type="button" data-model-example="IC-620">IC-620</button><button type="button" data-model-example="SMZ16-PRE">SMZ16-PRE</button><button type="button" data-model-example="XTS7">XTS7</button></div>
        <p id="model-search-hint" class="tt-small">This preview includes selected current and earlier models. Use the Document Center for the full collection.</p>
        <p class="tt-model-status d-sr-only" data-model-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div class="tt-model-results" data-model-results>
          <article class="tt-model-result"><div class="tt-model-art"><img src="/oct27/smz8.webp" width="220" height="150" alt="Russound SMZ8" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="tt-model-copy"><div class="tt-model-title"><h3>SMZ8</h3><span class="tt-model-badge">Current range</span></div><p>8-source, 8-zone controller amplifier</p><div class="tt-model-links"><a href="/products/smz8/">Explore product</a><a href="https://russound.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/SMZ8-Manual.pdf">Installation manual</a><a href="https://russound.com/products/smz8/">Official resources</a></div></div></article>
        </div>
        <noscript><p class="tt-small">Use the <a href="https://russound.com/document-center/">Russound Document Center</a> to look up your model, or enable JavaScript for this preview search.</p></noscript>
      </div>
      <div class="tt-support-help">
        <div class="tt-support-status"><h3>Support that stays with your system.</h3><p><strong>Current range</strong>Products in the reviewed Russound range.</p><p><strong>Earlier models</strong>Original information to help you maintain an existing system or plan its next chapter.</p></div>
        <div class="tt-support-links">
          <a href="https://russound.com/document-center/"><span>Documents &amp; downloads</span><small>Manuals, guides and available firmware</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
          <a href="https://russound.com/legacy-products/"><span>Earlier products</span><small>Explore Russound's legacy collection</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
          <a href="https://russound.com/dealer-locator/"><span>Help with your system</span><small>Connect with a Russound dealer</small><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>import '../../scripts/handoff-tools';</script>
